      (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) hide)
    )
    (property "Note" "Holds the FET off while the MCU is in reset or the dev board is out of its socket. Without it a floating gate can sit the K-line permanently dominant, which jams diagnostics for every other tool on the bus -- a failure that looks like a dead car, not a dead shield" (at 46.99 219.8 270)
      (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) hide)
    )
