    (property "Note" "Lower leg: 9 V recessive gives 2.81 V, clear of the 2.48 V worst-case input-high threshold. Above 11.5 V the clamp takes over and the upper leg carries about 0.47 mA at 14 V -- 6 mW, continuous, and the reason this is 22k rather than something stiffer" (at 46.99 259.17 270)
