      (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) hide)
    )
    (property "Note" "Second CAN controller, on SPI. Pin 11 SDI is the controller's input, so it lands on the MCU's MOSI; pin 12 SDO is its output and lands on MISO -- naming them CAN2_MOSI/CAN2_MISO here keeps that straight, because SDI/SDO on a peripheral means the opposite of what it means on a host. VERIFY THE PART NUMBER against the live catalogue before ordering, as with every other line on this board" (at 181.61 158.21 0)
