    (property "Note" "Crystal load cap, sized for Y1's 12 pF CL: C1=C2=2*(CL - Cstray) = 2*(12 - 5) = 14 pF, and 15 pF is the nearest E-series value. Re-check this if the crystal is substituted -- CL varies part to part, and an oscillator that starts on the bench but not at -20 C is the classic way to get it wrong" (at 273.05 21.68 270)
